This repository is public so that the games can be published on the web, not to grant
rights over them. All of its contents (code, text, designs, characters, names, artwork,
music, sounds and any other material of "Fans Of", "Fans of Rumble" and "Fans of TD")
belong to their authors, who reserve all rights.

Without prior written permission from the authors, you may NOT:

  1. Copy, modify, adapt or translate this material, or create derivative works.
  2. Distribute, publish, host or make it available to others, in whole or in part,
     modified or not, for free or for a fee.
  3. Use it, in whole or in part, in another game, app, website or product.
  4. Sell, rent, sublicense or commercially exploit it in any way.
  5. Use the names, characters or likeness of the games to present another work as
     official or as related to them.
  6. Use it to train or evaluate artificial intelligence systems.

You MAY, without asking:

  a. Play the games on the website where their authors publish them.
  b. View this repository and do on GitHub what its Terms of Service grant any user
     over a public repository (for example, viewing and forking it within GitHub).
     This grants no other right over the contents.

Anyone who submits a contribution to this repository (for example, a pull request)
agrees that the authors may use, modify and publish it as part of the games without
limitation, and states that they have the right to contribute it.

This repository uses third-party typefaces ("Luckiest Guy" and "Baloo 2"), loaded from
Google Fonts and governed by their own licenses. This license does not cover them.

